    "type": "game",
    "name": "Let Catch Me",
    "steam_appid": 3627940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Catch me is set in a dark and eerie forest where the player is lost and disoriented. As they struggle to find a way out, they soon realize they are not alone. Grotesque and terrifying creatures lurk in the shadows, forcing the player to either evade or eliminate them in order to survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game features a Bodycam perspective, providing a more immersive and realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Built on the latest Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers high-end graphics, enhancing realism and intensifying the eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective is to escape from enemies and defeat them by taking their photos to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO MAIN GAME MODES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Consists of 9 rounds for you to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You must find key items in each round to progress to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- As you advance, enemies become faster and more numerous, requiring quick reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An infinite survival mode with no rounds, focusing on scoring points by taking photos of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The higher your score, the higher your rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The longer you play, the more enemies will appear, and they will move faster, making survival increasingly difficult.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Catch me is set in a dark and eerie forest where the player is lost and disoriented. As they struggle to find a way out, they soon realize they are not alone. Grotesque and terrifying creatures lurk in the shadows, forcing the player to either evade or eliminate them in order to survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game features a Bodycam perspective, providing a more immersive and realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Built on the latest Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers high-end graphics, enhancing realism and intensifying the eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main objective is to escape from enemies and defeat them by taking their photos to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO MAIN GAME MODES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Consists of 9 rounds for you to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You must find key items in each round to progress to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- As you advance, enemies become faster and more numerous, requiring quick reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An infinite survival mode with no rounds, focusing on scoring points by taking photos of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The higher your score, the higher your rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The longer you play, the more enemies will appear, and they will move faster, making survival increasingly difficult.</p>",
    "short_description": "Let Catch Me is a bodycam-perspective survival horror game. In the game, players must survive in a cramped, eerie, and terrifying forest are combined with the horror demons, where players must to take pictures to score and to gain chances of survival and escape from enemies",
